algorithms.pseudocode:
Input: Finite lattice L with elements, join operation sup, bottom bot
Output: Set of sup-irreducible elements (F1-points)

function ExtractF1Points(L):
    result = empty set
    for each v in L \ {bot}:
        is_irred = true
        for each (a, b) in L x L:
            if sup(a, b) = v and a != v and b != v:
                is_irred = false
                break
        if is_irred:
            result = result union {v}
    return result

Complexity: O(n^3) time, O(n) space
